# "Return it to the battlefield under its owner's control": Bot1 steals Bot2's Ornithopter with a kicked Thieving Skydiver (X = 1, mana value 0 or less)
# and blinks it with Ephemerate. The Ornithopter comes back as a new object (CR 400.7) under Bot2's control, its owner's, and the steal is over.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Black Lotus
Thieving Skydiver
Ephemerate
Plains x3
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Thieving Skydiver.Cast(Kicked: 1)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ephemerate.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield = Plains; Thieving Skydiver
